[{"client_msg_id":"8ebf67ee-8a19-4f46-95fd-d3d342c19be7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01PF3M1PEW/p1621154952458000\u003e なんですけど、Nodeでサービス運用してる人がいたらどうやってるかとかめっちゃ知見聞きたいです","ts":"1621155313.315900","attachments":[{"fallback":"[May 16th, 2021 1:49 AM] yuki.ycino: 技術選定の話なんですけど、フロントNextで書いててバックエンド置くとしたら何使います？\n現実的にNextのAPIが大規模に耐えうるものなのか全く分からんって状態で困っており","id":1,"author_id":"U8996GYBF","author_name":"ycino","author_subname":"ycino","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U8996GYBF","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2018-03-09/327298108645_48b1c10b3cf4092337c5_48.png","text":"技術選定の話なんですけど、フロントNextで書いててバックエンド置くとしたら何使います？\n現実的にNextのAPIが大規模に耐えうるものなのか全く分からんって状態で困っており","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #tech-coding","ts":1621154952.458000,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01PF3M1PEW/p1621154952458000","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01PF3M1PEW/p1621154952458000"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01UVCK03CL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xOx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b911183f-f3b4-49f6-91fb-782756935599","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今度はこれで詰んでる・・・\n\u003chttps://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/6018\u003e","ts":"1621151005.315000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pl1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fd66385-954a-415d-b23f-16f707369ba0","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"ド・モルガン！","ts":"1621150680.314600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j9q3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"839b3af2-b739-463d-9603-deb78f50a1da","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"確かに、集合的に逆のことをやってますね","ts":"1621150504.314400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EI3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6548fb0b-626e-4811-b01e-c51c08d840c6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`if (systems.game_system.every((v) =\u0026gt; v.id != system))`","ts":"1621150346.313700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RsQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"312124f9-7a1e-4fe8-b3d7-c14215bf2726","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"これ every で書けません?","ts":"1621150301.313200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9SXE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ef0e339-c63b-4a8a-8506-c652b55a164f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```      const system = await vimArgs.pop(commands, 'system', 'DiceBot');\n      const systems = await api.get(`game_system`).json\u0026lt;apiTypes.GameSystemRes\u0026gt;();\n      if (false === systems.game_system.some((v) =\u0026gt; v.id == system)) {\n        console.error(`${system} is not available.`);\n        return;\n      }```\nこんな感じにしました `some` 便利","ts":"1621150133.312500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NCi6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9aa1071c-14d9-4797-8a73-b42354a6af91","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"NextとNestを組み合わせて環境構築で地獄を見ている","ts":"1621149250.311800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tno"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e558586d-339d-43e8-b25b-e8e721150044","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"`new Map()` と `Object.fromEntries()` は引数形式が同じなので、この書き方してるなら簡単に乗り換えられますよ","ts":"1621148406.311500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NkzN1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7de2cb2-87ad-46e3-abc9-614f5c518893","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"JS のオブジェクトをコレクションとして使うの割と気を使う要素が多いので、できるだけ Map に入れちゃうな…それはそれで扱いづらいってのもわからなくはないけど","ts":"1621148368.310800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M/Gm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d7ec185-7713-4600-9fb6-c92cb045295a","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"lodash 使うとコードは簡潔になるが、最近みんな lodash 消したがりますね\n`const systemMap = _.keyBy(res.game_system, ({id}) =\u0026gt; id);`","ts":"1621148324.309800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SpB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54d009b6-7d3c-48bc-8146-a51a0672e6f9","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"あー `fromEntries` ってそう使うんですね","ts":"1621148321.309700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zFu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71586197-2678-43b7-a813-564e24e09101","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"`const systemMap = Object.fromEntries(res.game_system.map(system =\u0026gt; [system.id, system]));`\nmap と言いつつ、つい Object 作ってしまうな","ts":"1621148081.307500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kKRq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca0ce9c5-be34-4468-adfe-85270cc90c32","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"あとで任意に参照するなら map にいれますね。定数で作っちゃったり cache 的な扱いにしたりは実装により","ts":"1621147850.307000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yKnSQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9aeb41ae-a401-4993-a4d7-181d85dd9907","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"見た目上forを消したいだけならsomeでよさそう","ts":"1621147848.306900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y7+Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9bdb962-9085-4daa-a3b3-13f1bc5becd5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ループ自体を消したいならidをキーにしてオブジェクトかMapに放り込む、ですかね","ts":"1621147762.305500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MVRYW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6d8b627-9897-42a5-b708-cf12edd099a5","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"php の連想配列だと、 array_column してから、 in_array すればチェックできて便利？なんですが","ts":"1621147761.305400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DVzRU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7547f99b-7946-4700-93db-54354ef65adf","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"やっぱりそうなりますか…","ts":"1621147726.304600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JvA3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9602e38-a637-47f1-b66b-4cf0095b18b9","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"for か filter か some か、いずれにしてもループ処理になりますが","ts":"1621147695.304300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VUp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7efda9c2-c810-49ee-9370-76923b2dcd1c","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```export type GameSystemRes = {\n  \"game_system\": GameSystem[];\n};\n\nexport type GameSystem = {\n  \"id\": string;\n  \"name\": string;\n  \"sort_key\": string;\n};```\nの定義の `GameSystemRes` な変数があるんですが、for で回さずに `id` の一致する `GameSystem` オブジェクトが存在しているかチェックしたいんですが","ts":"1621147633.303700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RwA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3974695-e6b5-419a-b444-d556fcad4886","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あ、よく見たら webpack はすでに 5 だった。セーフ","ts":"1621147504.301900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OZlK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b18c228e-50bb-428e-8997-e697606c3c28","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"初手 esbuild は全然よさそうだけど、すでに webpack を設定済みなのと、大して大きくないから速度でも困ってないので一旦 webpack はこのままキープで行くか。問題はこのあと 4 から 5 にする作業が結局あるw","ts":"1621147242.301300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P57b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9a3d8b9-0028-4712-bded-d71ec0ababc1","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"esbuild導入進めてますがまあ大差ないしこのままでいいかな","ts":"1621119926.300100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NGO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b974e21e-9e71-4ba2-8c39-fa41e6f064c6","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なるほど","ts":"1621119904.299600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ba1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54045669-6be7-4b7f-b2c2-30f3848acd4e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"setup-vim で今まで webpack を使っていたのだけど、試しに esbuild を使ってみたら minify 後のサイズが少し大きくなってしまったな\nwebpack 971,370\nesbuild 1,005,866","ts":"1621119627.299400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"evT0m"}]}]
